 then was it  just a mistake  I think it was definitely a political  error without any doubt why because how  do you send out a message of that  enormity without evaluating the  consequences  is now being held in prison for the next  18 months before his trial because  prosecutors say there's a Flight Risk  that's based on his actions on the 7th  of December the president of Mexico said  that he'd asked for asylum in Mexico and  it's been reported that he was on his  way to the Mexican embassy he was trying  to flee you know he was trying to leave  the country  he never called the president and said I  want Asylum he did go to the Embassy so  I think what he wanted was to look for  protection in that moment because steel  didn't make it to the Embassy attends  you say that he's now appealing against  his prison time based on the  regularities in the process to remove  him from office  but the issues at stake in Peru have now  gone beyond one man people want new  elections some want a changed  Constitution well from his prison cell  their former president has another fight  on his hands  John Holman Al Jazeera Lima
 

